### ============================================================
### EduCluster — Dashboard API Collection
### Path PERSIS yang dipanggil FE (client/src/hooks/useDashboardSummary.js):
###   api.get('/dashboard') => GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/dashboard
### Konfirmasi route BE: server/src/routes/index.js (mount /dashboard)
###   + server/src/routes/dashboard.routes.js (router.get('/'))
### ============================================================

@BASE_URL = http://localhost:3000/api
@EMAIL = admin@edukluster.test
@PASSWORD = password123

### 1) LOGIN — ambil token (hasil: 200, body.token disimpan manual di blok berikutnya)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2) GET DASHBOARD SUMMARY — WAJIB 200 (dengan token)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer tempel-token-dari-respon-login-di-atas

### 3) GET DASHBOARD SUMMARY — WAJIB 401 (tanpa token)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/dashboard

### 4) GET PERIODE AKTIF — pembanding sehat (WAJIB 200 dengan token)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/periodes/active
Authorization: Bearer tempel-token-dari-respon-login-di-atas
